==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|sh}} {{recons|jebati|lang=sla-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|sh}} {{recons|h₃yebʰ-|lang=ine-pro}}. Cognate with Ancient Greek {{term|οἴφω|sc=Grek|tr=oíphō|lang=grc}}, Sanskrit {{term|यभति|sc=Deva|tr=yabhati|lang=sa}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/jěbati/|lang=sh}}
* {{hyphenation|је|ба|ти}}

===Verb===
{{sh-verb|head=јѐбати|c|jebati|jèbati}} {{pf.}} and {{impf}}

# {{context|vulgar|lang=sh}} to [[fuck]]
#: {{usex|Желим да га '''јебем''' у његово длакаво дупе.|lang=sh}}

